Combined edition by marumimamori, 2026-10-03:
- Preserves Kanban, Spotlight and Cards view IDs and behavior.
- Adds one settings page with a tab for each layout, independent Base/view libraries,
  synced view options, Kanban/Autotag styling, shared setup and combined credits.
- Mutes saved custom columns when only ordinary property columns are in use.
- Migrates source plugin data into separate namespaces with serialized saves.
- Retains the source plugins and their data for rollback; no Base rewrite on migration.

